iv id=\"pgc-1708-1-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-1708-1-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-first-child panel-last-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"1\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n\t<h2>EATON FIRE DAMAGE ATTORNEYS<br \/>\nFire Damage Insurance Claim?<br \/>\nOur Lawyers Can Help<\/h2>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pg-1708-2\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-no-style\" ><div id=\"pgc-1708-2-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-1708-2-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_black-studio-tinymce widget_black_studio_tinymce panel-first-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"2\" ><div class=\"panel-widget-style panel-widget-style-for-1708-2-0-0\" ><div class=\"textwidget\"><h2>Eaton Wildfire Victims: Get Help With Insurance Claims and Legal Representation<\/h2>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"panel-1708-2-0-1\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-image widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"3\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-image so-widget-sow-image-default-c67d20f9f743-1708\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"sow-image-container\">\n\t\t<img \n\tdata-src=\"https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Pasadena-family.jpg\" width=\"707\" height=\"707\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Pasadena-family.jpg 1792w, https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Pasadena-family-300x171.jpg 300w, https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Pasadena-family-1024x585.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Pasadena-family-768x439.jpg 768w, https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Pasadena-family-1536x878.jpg 1536w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 707px) 100vw, 707px\" title=\"Pasadena family\" alt=\"\" \t\tclass=\"so-widget-image lazyload\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 707px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 707\/707;\" \/>\n\t<\/div>\n\n<\/div><\/div><div id=\"panel-1708-2-0-2\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_black-studio-tinymce widget_black_studio_tinymce widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"4\" ><div class=\"textwidget\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The recent wildfires in Los Angeles, Pasadena, Altadena, and Pacific Palisades have devastated our communities. Homes have been destroyed, families displaced, and lives turned upside down. At Franco Mu\u00f1oz Law Firm, we are here to help you navigate the aftermath, whether you need assistance with an insurance claim, legal guidance, or answers about what caused the fire.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you\u2019ve been impacted by the wildfires, call us today at (510) 257-4141 for a free consultation. Our experienced attorneys are here to fight for the compensation you deserve.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3>When Safety Comes First: Protect Your Family and Follow Cal Fire Orders<\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Your safety and the safety of your loved ones should always be your first priority. Evacuate early and follow all Cal Fire orders to avoid unnecessary risks. Firefighters can only work to save homes after ensuring that all residents are safely out of harm\u2019s way.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you\u2019re returning to your property after evacuation, proceed cautiously and document any visible damages. Your safety remains critical, even after the immediate threat of fire has passed.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3>File Your Insurance Claim Quickly to Avoid Delays<\/h3>\n<\/div><\/div><div id=\"panel-1708-2-0-3\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-image panel-last-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"5\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-image so-widget-sow-image-default-c67d20f9f743-1708\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"sow-image-container\">\n\t\t<img \n\tdata-src=\"https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/avoid-delay.png\" width=\"1024\" height=\"585\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/avoid-delay.png 1024w, https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/avoid-delay-300x171.png 300w, https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/avoid-delay-768x439.png 768w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" alt=\"\" \t\tclass=\"so-widget-image lazyload\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024\/585;\" \/>\n\t<\/div>\n\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pgc-1708-2-1\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-1708-2-1-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_black-studio-tinymce widget_black_studio_tinymce panel-first-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"6\" ><div class=\"form-sec panel-widget-style panel-widget-style-for-1708-2-1-0\" ><div class=\"textwidget\"><h2>Contact Us Now<\/h2><p>For A Free Case Evaluation<\/p><small>Please enter a valid email address<\/small><div class=\"wpforms-container wpforms-container-full\" id=\"wpforms-28\"><form id=\"wpforms-form-28\" class=\"wpforms-validate wpforms-form\" data-formid=\"28\" method=\"post\" enctype=\"multipart\/form-data\" action=\"\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/1708\" data-token=\"56ef3efad4cece98a44e621745a766bd\" data-token-time=\"1785363724\"><noscript class=\"wpforms-error-noscript\">Please enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.<\/noscript><div class=\"wpforms-field-container\"><div id=\"wpforms-28-field_3-container\" class=\"wpforms-field wpforms-field-text\" data-field-type=\"text\" data-field-id=\"3\"><label class=\"wpforms-field-label wpforms-label-hide\" for=\"wpforms-28-field_3\">Name <span class=\"wpforms-required-label\">*<\/span><\/label><input type=\"text\" id=\"wpforms-28