\" height=\"153\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/estela-1.jpg 152w, https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/estela-1-150x150.jpg 150w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 152px) 100vw, 152px\" title=\"Estela Barajas\" alt=\"\" \t\tclass=\"so-widget-image lazyload\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 152px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 152\/153;\" \/>\n\t<\/div>\n\n<h3 class=\"widget-title\">Estela Barajas<\/h3><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pgc-w663883675856d-2-1\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-w663883675856d-2-1-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-image panel-first-child panel-last-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"4\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-image so-widget-sow-image-default-c67d20f9f743\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"sow-image-container\">\n\t\t<img \n\tdata-src=\"https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/stephan-1.jpg\" width=\"152\" height=\"153\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/stephan-1.jpg 152w, https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/stephan-1-150x150.jpg 150w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 152px) 100vw, 152px\" title=\"Laura Stephans\" alt=\"\" \t\tclass=\"so-widget-image lazyload\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 152px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 152\/153;\" \/>\n\t<\/div>\n\n<h3 class=\"widget-title\">Laura Stephans<\/h3><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pg-w663883675856d-3\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-no-style\" ><div id=\"pgc-w663883675856d-3-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell panel-grid-cell-mobile-last\" ><div id=\"panel-w663883675856d-3-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-image panel-first-child panel-last-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"5\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-image so-widget-sow-image-default-c67d20f9f743\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"sow-image-container\">\n\t\t<img \n\tdata-src=\"https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/daniel-1.jpg\" width=\"152\" height=\"153\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/daniel-1.jpg 152w, https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/daniel-1-150x150.jpg 150w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 152px) 100vw, 152px\" title=\"Daniel Alvarez\" alt=\"\" \t\tclass=\"so-widget-image lazyload\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 152px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 152\/153;\" \/>\n\t<\/div>\n\n<h3 class=\"widget-title\">Daniel Alvarez<\/h3><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pgc-w663883675856d-3-1\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell panel-grid-cell-empty\" ><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pg-1708-3\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-has-style\" ><div class=\"panel-row-style panel-row-style-for-1708-3\" ><div id=\"pgc-1708-3-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-1708-3-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-first-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"8\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n\t<p>Taking immediate action after a wildfire is crucial. Here\u2019s how to get started with your insurance claim:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Open Your Claim ASAP:<\/strong> Contact your insurance provider right away. The sooner you file, the faster your claim can be assigned and processed.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Understand Your Policy:<\/strong> Ask for your Declarations Page to review your coverage limits. Knowing the monetary caps and timeframes for your policy is key, especially as limits may be extended during a State of Emergency.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Track All Displacement Expenses:<\/strong> Save receipts for temporary lodging, meals, and other emergency costs. These expenses are often covered under most homeowner\u2019s insurance policies.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Document Your Losses:<\/strong> Take photos and videos of property damage and destroyed belongings. If your home is still at risk, create a video walkthrough to document everything before it\u2019s too late.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>We\u2019re Here to Stand With Wildfire Victims From Pasadena, Pacific Palisades, Altadena and Los Angeles County<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><div id=\"panel-1708-3-0-1\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-image widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"9\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-image so-widget-sow-image-default-c67d20f9f743-1708\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"sow-image-container\">\n\t\t<img \n\tdata-src=\"https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/stand.png\" width=\"1024\" height=\"585\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/stand.png 1024w, https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/stand-300x171.png 300w, https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/stand-768x439.png 768w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" alt=\"\" \t\tclass=\"so-widget-image lazyload\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024\/585;\" \/>\n\t<\/div>\n\n<\/div><\/div><div id=\"panel-1708-3-0-2\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"10\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n\t<p>At Franco Mu\u00f1oz Law Firm, we specialize in helping fire victims rebuild their lives. Whether you\u2019re facing challenges with your insurance company or want to understand your legal options, our experienced attorneys are ready to fight for your rights.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Compassionate Support:<\/strong> We understand the emotional and financial toll of wildfires and are here to ease your burden.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Results You Can Trust:<\/strong> Our team has years of experience securing compensation for victims of disasters, including fire damage claims.<\/li>\n<li><strong>No Upfront Costs:<\/strong> You don\u2019t pay unless we win your case.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3>Investigating Edison Electric Company\u2019s Role in the Los Angeles Wildfires<\/h3>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><div id=\"panel-1708-3-0-3\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-image widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"11\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-image so-widget-sow-image-default-c67d20f9f743-1708\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"sow-image-container\">\n\t\t<img \n\tdata-src=\"https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/fire.png\" width=\"1024\" height=\"585\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/fire.png 1024w, https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/fire-300x171.png 300w, https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/fire-768x439.png 768w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" alt=\"\" \t\tclass=\"so-widget-image lazyload\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024\/585;\" \/>\n\t<\/div>\n\n<\/div><\/div><div id=\"panel-1708-3-0-4\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"12\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n\t<p>Recent reports suggest that the Los Angeles wildfires may have been caused by negligence on the part of Southern California Edison (Edison). Investigations are ongoing into whether equipment failures or inadequate maintenance of power lines contributed to these devastating fires.<\/p>\n<p>Southern California Edison has received notices from insurance companies to preserve evidence related to the Eaton Fire in Los Angeles, which is still burning. However, the utility company claims that no fire agencies have identified their equipment as the cause of the fire. <a href=\"https:\/\/www.reuters.com\/business\/environment\/edison-denies-la-wildfire-involvement-insurers-ask-it-preserve-evidence-2025-01-10\/?utm_source=chatgpt.com\">According to a preliminary analysis by Edison<\/a>, there were no interruptions or anomalies in their transmission lines until over an hour after the reported start of the fire.<\/p>\n<p>In the past, Edison has faced scrutiny and <a href=\"https:\/\/apnews.com\/article\/thomas-fire-southern-california-edison-settlement-90e7433738980976b42b07ebb6ab49c1?utm_source=chatgpt.com\">legal action<\/a> for its role in other wildfires. For instance, the utility agreed to pay $80 million to settle claims related to the 2017 Thomas Fire, which destroyed more than a thousand homes and other structures.<\/p>\n<h3>What This Means for You:<\/h3>\n<p>If Southern California Edison is found liable, victims may be entitled to significant compensation for property damage, displacement expenses, personal injuries, and more.<\/p>\n<p>At Franco Mu\u00f1oz Law Firm, we are actively monitoring these developments. Our attorneys have extensive experience handling cases involving utility companies and will work tirelessly to hold them accountable.<\/p>\n<h3>Caution: Beware of Public Adjusters and Unnecessary Fees<\/h3>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><div id=\"panel-1708-3-0-5\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-image widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"13\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-image so-widget-sow-image-default-c67d20f9f743-1708\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"sow-image-container\">\n\t\t<img \n\tdata-src=\"https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/High-Fees-1.jpg\" width=\"1024\" height=\"585\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/High-Fees-1.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/High-Fees-1-300x171.jpg 300w, https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/High-Fees-1-768x439.jpg 768w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" title=\"High Fees\" alt=\"\" \t\tclass=\"so-widget-image lazyload\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024\/585;\" \/>\n\t<\/div>\n\n<\/div><\/div><div id=\"panel-1708-3-0-6\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"14\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n\t<p>After a disaster, many victims turn to public adjusters for help navigating insurance claims. However, these professionals often take a significant portion of your settlement\u2014not just on additional coverage they secure but on the total amount awarded.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Our Advice:<br \/>\n<\/strong>Work directly with your insurance company first. If you encounter issues, contact a qualified attorney to ensure your rights are protected and your compensation is maximized.<\/p>\n<h3>Helpful Resources for Wildfire Victims<\/h3>\n<p>Recovery after a wildfire can feel overwhelming, but you don\u2019t have to face it alone. Here are some resources to support your journey:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Evacuation Orders and Updates:<\/strong> Stay informed through <a href=\"https:\/\/www.fire.ca.gov\/\">Cal Fire<\/a>.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Insurance Guidance:<\/strong> Learn more from the California Department of Insurance at <a href=\"https:\/\/www.insurance.ca.gov\/\">insurance.ca.gov<\/a>.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Emergency Shelters and Support:<\/strong> Contact the Red Cross for immediate assistance.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><div id=\"panel-1708-3-0-7\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"15\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n\t<h3>Don\u2019t Face the Aftermath Alone: Call Us Today<\/h3>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><div id=\"panel-1708-3-0-8\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"16\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n\t<p><script src=\"https:\/\/fast.wistia.com\/embed\/medias\/gadw8m3bgo.jsonp\" async><\/script><script src=\"https:\/\/fast.wistia.com\/assets\/external\/E-v1.js\" async><\/script><\/p>\n<div class=\"wistia_responsive_padding\" style=\"padding:56.25% 0 0 0;position:relative;\">\n<div class=\"wistia_responsive_wrapper\" style=\"height:100%;left:0;position:absolute;top:0;width:100%;\"><span class=\"wistia_embed wistia_async_gadw8m3bgo popover=true videoFoam=true\" style=\"display:inline-block;height:100%;position:relative;width:100%\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><div id=\"panel-1708-3-0-9\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-last-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"17\" ><div class=\"panel-widget-style panel-widget-style-for-1708-3-0-9\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n\t<p>The road to recovery after a wildfire is long, but you don\u2019t have to navigate it alone. At Franco Mu\u00f1oz Law Firm, we\u2019re committed to helping you get the compensation you deserve.<\/p>\n<p>Call <strong>(510) 257-4141<\/strong> today for a free consultation, or contact us online. Together, we\u2019ll ensure your voice is heard and your rights are protected.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>EATON FIRE DAMAGE ATTORNEYS Fire Damage Insurance Claim? Our Lawyers Can Help<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":686,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_genesis_hide_title":false,"_genesis_hide_breadcrumbs":false,"_genesis_hide_singular_image":false,"_genesis_hide_footer_widgets":false,"_genesis_custom_body_class":"hide-title","_genesis_custom_post_class":"","_genesis_layout":"","footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-1708","page","type-page","status-publish","entry"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v28.1 (Yoast SEO v28.1) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-premium-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Eaton Fire Attorneys - Workers Comp Attorney| Franco Munoz<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Get a free &amp; confidential consultation. Call us right after your accident for a complimentary 24\/7 no-obligation case evaluation with one of our Top Work Injury Lawyers.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/francomunos.com\/personal-injury\/eaton-fire-attorneys\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Eaton Fire Attorneys\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Get a Free &amp; Confidential consultation. Call us right after your accident for a complimentary 24\/7 no-obligation case evaluation with one of our Top Work Injury Lawyers.\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/francomunos.com\/personal-injury\/eaton-fire-attorneys\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Workers Comp Attorney| Franc